Dear Daniel,

thank you for your answer. Yes, your suggestion is welcome: I have not read now the scetion of the doc on writing samplers but yes this would be a solution. All the more so that I would be interested in other extensions.

For the definition of the params:

nadaptPN: yes you are correct: this would consist in actually "freezing" the parameter (=not updating it=not sampling it) for the firt nadaptPN iterations.

nadaptSN: yes: this is what I had in mind.

Sincerely,

Frédéric

